WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Start by identifying who made the claim.
Write their name beside the date.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.560
Give the reply its own line and identify
who issued it.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:16.320
On the third line, write what the
available records establish. If they
leave a question open, keep that question
visible.
